                            {
                                "target_word": "overcrowding",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65cd8bb4-4dcc-3e58-8d61-b523d3e091ad",
                                        "entry_id": "d2b3b47c-cbdd-3a94-9634-8ebf8eb8a965",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The situation where a space holds more occupants than it can comfortably accommodate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c772b90-620f-4b10-9fd5-9846acf1a079",
                                                "sense_id": "65cd8bb4-4dcc-3e58-8d61-b523d3e091ad",
                                                "text": "Stops at Fareham, Havant and Chichester add to the cattle-like conditions aboard, although as the door nearest me is blocked by prams and suitcases, my coach is protected from the worst overcrowding."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0dbc08ce-9022-409f-b013-dc14753c38fb",
                                                "sense_id": "65cd8bb4-4dcc-3e58-8d61-b523d3e091ad",
                                                "text": "[…] there are sublettings, overcrowdings of lands, clearances, and emigrations going on; and want of employment, with consequent destitution and wretchedness is the complaint of the majority of the inhabitants."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5517189d-6b08-42c0-9a4d-205c069f5aed",
                                                "sense_id": "65cd8bb4-4dcc-3e58-8d61-b523d3e091ad",
                                                "text": "An extra rush-hour train has eased overcrowding of the former 5.39 p.m. to Salisbury; this now leaves at 5.43 and an additional electric service to Alton departs at 5.39 p.m."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47defcde-4755-48ad-a922-087b2bcefc19",
                                                "sense_id": "65cd8bb4-4dcc-3e58-8d61-b523d3e091ad",
                                                "text": "Department for Transport statistics show that since 2010 overcrowding in the morning peak at 11 cities has risen by 48%, to reach 280,000 standing passengers daily."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "49def43d-c501-445c-b5e3-cf28705daa43",
                        "source_entry_id": "f0ca3c1f-17c8-3e13-8fe0-ff9c3a1b8f7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1cb83f4d-08bf-3af8-b294-556cc86f3754",
                        "source_sense_description": "toestand waarbij een ruimte, gebied of land zo dichtbevolkt is dat het problemen geeft",
                        "target_lang_word": "overpopulation",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "overpopulation",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a51c704e-a435-38a4-9c78-151dbcf6dbbb",
                                        "entry_id": "e9bd54f2-5d4f-36a0-a04e-f87be667d8b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An excessive number of occupants (people, animals, plants, etc.) in a particular area; specifically, when the number of occupants exceeds the ability of that area to provide for them."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f364271f-0f7a-4dc0-b07e-6c4b18787b08",
                                                "sense_id": "a51c704e-a435-38a4-9c78-151dbcf6dbbb",
                                                "text": "I hope for another end, though not, indeed, from any of the three remedies for over-population commonly suggested by economists. These three are, in brief—Colonization; Bringing in of waste lands; or Discouragement of Marriage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a5ceac2-1fd6-4adb-8e8e-9ea1c949f5e7",
                                                "sense_id": "a51c704e-a435-38a4-9c78-151dbcf6dbbb",
                                                "text": "Over the whole extent of the South Seas, from one tropic to another, we find traces of a bygone state of over-population, when the resources of even a tropical soil were taxed, and even the improvident Polynesian trembled for the future."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98fd3fda-da60-4d2f-94c4-3df57e6b034d",
                                                "sense_id": "a51c704e-a435-38a4-9c78-151dbcf6dbbb",
                                                "text": "When it comes to overpopulation as the cause of wildlife loss in Africa, Prince William just won't let it go."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac30d1d4-16cf-4c14-9e16-4e500864b3b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "f0ca3c1f-17c8-3e13-8fe0-ff9c3a1b8f7a",
                        "source_sense_id": "1cb83f4d-08bf-3af8-b294-556cc86f3754",
                        "source_sense_description": "toestand waarbij een ruimte, gebied of land zo dichtbevolkt is dat het problemen geeft",
